WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Extensively drug-resistant TB: can three pills for six months cure it?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Nix-TB treated 109 patients patients with highly resistant TB in South Africa.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Favourable outcome: 90% of patients.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
For XDR-TB: 89%, against a historical average of 14% in South Africa.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
The cost: peripheral neuropathy in 81%, myelosuppression in 48%.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
BPaL gave a favourable outcome in 90%. N Engl J Med, 2020. Scroll for the full breakdown.
